               :content {:text "Phenomenon P3 deals with the queries based on predicates. Proscribing P3 requires that a transaction T 2 cannot modify a predicate P by inserting, updating, or deleting a row such that its modiﬁcation changes the result of a query executed by an uncommitted transaction T 1 based on predicate P; to avoid this situation, T1 acquires a long phantom read-lock [14] on predicate P."},
